ElastiCache Data Link (ECDL): third-party software

ECDL's own code is licensed under MIT-0 (see LICENSE). The container images
that ./release.sh push builds include the third-party software below, each
under its own license. The license texts are at the source URLs listed, and
inside the images (package metadata, /debezium, /opt/java/openjdk/legal).

Versions are those pinned by this repository: the Dockerfiles (base images,
by digest), backend/requirements.lock, data-plane/bulk-loader/requirements.lock,
frontend/package-lock.json and tools/go-sink/go.mod. Only software that ships
in an image is listed; build and test tools (Vite, Vitest, the Go toolchain,
the JDK used to compile the broker writer) do not.


